menu "sys_watch"

    #@limit @alias Watches
    config SYS_WATCH_MAX
        int "Watches"
        default 24
        range 1 64
        help
          Reads run by a trigger, of every owner (each cached read of another
          board is one there); each keeps its read and the CRC of its last
          entry sent (ON_CHANGE).

    config SYS_WATCH_CLIENT_MAX
        int "Watches on other boards"
        default 24
        range 1 64
        help
          Watches this board added on other boards (each read of a remote
          device is one): the board, the id and where its entries go.

    config SYS_WATCH_IDLE_MIN_MS
        int "Cached read idle floor (ms)"
        default 1000
        range 100 600000
        help
          A cached read's watch is removed on its board after 10 times its
          max age without a read, never sooner than this: a fast reader's
          pause does not remove and make it again.

endmenu
